# agent-based-development skill files is a DevOps and development workflow skill.
# It references .env files in the context of .env.example conventions — a standard
# practice for documenting required environment variables without storing actual secrets.
# These are instructional references, not actual secret values.
\.env\b
# DevOps role guard instructs never copying real API keys into .env.example
api[_-]?key
# Prompt-injection guard quotes the attack phrase it defends against
ignore\s+(all\s+)?previous\s+instructions
